    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexborn</strong> is a blood-fueled <i>roguelite FPS</i> where <i>90s-style shooter combat</i> meets <i>Vampire Survivors</i>-style progression and escalating dungeon fights. <br><br>Blast through ritual arenas with <strong>occult weapons</strong>, build devastating synergies mid-run, and survive a labyrinth that shifts, evolves, and seals shut behind you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/b58bc194f32ee62b9de371c937d6202c.poster.avif?t=1752834657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/b58bc194f32ee62b9de371c937d6202c.webm?t=1752834657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/b58bc194f32ee62b9de371c937d6202c.mp4?t=1752834657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> to be the first to descend into the Bloodstone Labyrinth \ud83d\udc80<br> <br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 BOOMER SHOOTER CHAOS MEETS RITUAL SURVIVORS COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight escalating waves in procedurally generated levels inspired by <i>Blood</i>, <i>Doom</i>, and 90s FPS brutality \u2014 every kill fuels the ritual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00<strong> EXPLORE A SHIFTING DUNGEON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Branching paths, cursed shrines, relic rooms, and twisted layouts keep every descent unpredictable and bring back the thrill of uncovering a world, not just surviving it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8<strong>\u00a0OCCULT ARSENAL</strong>   <br>Wield devastating tools like Lucian\u2019s triple-barreled shotgun, the Necronomicon spellbook, and the napalm launcher, all handcrafted to feel brutal, distinct, and satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e SURVIVORS-LIKE PROGRESSION WITH RETRO GUNPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up mid-run and choose from randomized perks across Blood, Fire, Shadow, and Machine archetypes. Stack synergies and evolve fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267b\ufe0f ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong> <br>Randomized perks, relic trades, enemy waves, and room layouts make every run a fresh, chaotic challenge and every build uniquely broken.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong><br>You play as <strong>Lucian Cross</strong>, a former cultist bound to an ancient demon. Cast into the shifting depths of the <strong>Bloodstone Labyrinth</strong>, you\u2019ll fight to stop the resurrection of a forgotten god, or be consumed by the power you're trying to destroy. Every run is a violent spiral deeper into madness, where your kills fuel new perks, and every choice carves a different path through cursed arenas, shrines, and sacrificial chambers.       <br>       <br>Slay relentless hordes, level up mid-fight, and craft your build from randomized perks tied to archetypes like <strong>Blood</strong>, <strong>Fire</strong>, <strong>Shadow</strong>, and <strong>Machine</strong>. Push forward because the dungeon is alive, the doors seal behind you, and the only way out is through..              <br>           <br>Prepare to descend into the darkness, where <strong>every choice could be your last</strong>.<br><br>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist Hexborn</strong> and prepare to descend \u2014 the only way out is through. </p>",
